  "body": "> On the docs site [here ](https://docs.pkgforge.dev/soar/readme/packages#host)soar is listed with the supported architectures of aarch64 and arm64. Is this list supposed to include x86_64?\n>\n> Section in question is [here ](https://github.com/pkgforge/docs/blob/5e8efc54b841531d3cbbd177305405f49b7aaaaf/soar/readme/packages.md?plain=1#L14C2236-L14C2411).\n> \n\nThanks for catching it.\nThere's probably several more of these errors/typos, feel free to list them if you find another.\n\n> Thank you for your work on these docs. The site is clean, detailed, and pleasing to look at. \n\nAlso thank you for the kind words, it means a lot",
